response:
APT28 orchestrated a cyber attack campaign targeting Ukrainian and Polish organizations in December 2023 using email lure links leveraging the ms-search protocol. The infection chain delivered MASEPIE, which subsequently downloaded and executed OpenSSH, STEELHOOK, and OCEANMAP, alongside network reconnaissance and lateral movement tools Impacket and SMBExec.

